  "loadSheddingGuide": "• Keep the fridge and freezer closed. A closed fridge stays cold for about 4 hours; a full freezer for about 48 hours (24 if half full).\n• For longer outages, move milk to a cooler bag with ice or frozen gel packs. Keep a few packs frozen for this.\n• If frozen milk has thawed, don't refreeze it: keep it cold and use it within 24 hours.",
